 "caption": "Gifford et al. 2014 Lab Chip 14, 4496\u20134505, Fig. 4 inset (the 300 \u00b5m bar, 107.52 px; the legs at 45.78\u00b0 on the image, from the post columns) with gifford2014_fig4_design: leg 4's last post rows and the leads beyond (cyan: the reproduction claim) and the neighbouring leg where the mask puts it (amber: the leg spacing and the legs' lengths are the generator's, not printed).  Registration: scale from the bar, rotation measured on the image; translation fitted on features and, independently, by chamfer matching (they agree within 0.6 / 0.2 px along / across).  Nearest-outline offset: median 2.65 \u00b5m, 90th percentile 17.80 \u00b5m (n 6859); for comparison 3.75 \u00b5m half a pitch along and 4.36 \u00b5m 5 \u00b5m across.  On the image: leg 4's post columns 159.2 \u00b5m apart (mask w_c + l_g = 156.8), pitch 45.83 / 45.84 \u00b5m (mask 46.1); the legs' centrelines 818 \u00b5m apart (mask 963).",
